title: The Cult of the Assassin
subtitle: A public commemoration of Eligiusz Niewiadomski; PPS decides how it answers.
new-page: true
tags: pl_event
face-image: img/polish/polish_event_niewiadomski_cult.jpg
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && !!Q.polish_politics_rules && PolishPolitics.cultDue(Q) !}
on-arrival: {!
// Event society.niewiadomski_cult, B5 (technical reference 17.7, 17.4, 15.2; card catalogue 9.6): one named public
// commemoration of the assassin, only in the historical branch of the assassination of Narutowicz; three answers,
// 0 T. Stage 8 (8f): the commemoration is the funeral at Powązki on 6 II 1923 and the services of February 1923
// (HISTORICAL_SOURCES.md); the answers of PPS and the mass for democracy are alternatives of the game.
PolishPolitics.cultView(Q);
!}

= A commemoration of the assassin

Eligiusz Niewiadomski, who killed President Narutowicz, was executed on 31 January 1923. On 6 February about ten thousand people follow his funeral at the Powązki cemetery in Warsaw, with a requiem mass, and services in his honour are announced in churches in other towns. PPS must decide how its members and organisations answer. Opposing the cult of a murderer is not a position on religion or on the Church.

- @condemn
- @democracy_mass
- @disrupt
- @stay_out

@condemn
title: Condemn the cult and order our members not to disturb the service
subtitle: No cost. Our members keep away from the churches; the Christian Democrats may join the condemnation if they are close to us.
choose-if: {! return PolishPolitics.cultStatus(Q, 'condemn').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_b5_condemn_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishPolitics.cultChoose(Q, 'condemn');
!}
go-to: result

@democracy_mass
title: Organise a mass for the defence of democracy
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. It needs a priest who agrees to celebrate it; the mass in defence of democracy strengthens it (+2), without changing our view of the Church.
choose-if: {! return PolishPolitics.cultStatus(Q, 'democracy_mass').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_b5_democracy_mass_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishPolitics.cultChoose(Q, 'democracy_mass');
!}
go-to: result

@disrupt
title: Break up the services with the Milicja
subtitle: Cost: half a resource. It needs a free Milicja; the Centrum of the party protests (+8) and the Christian Democrats are outraged; a clash may bring a case against PPS and even a ban of the Milicja.
choose-if: {! return PolishPolitics.cultStatus(Q, 'disrupt').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_b5_disrupt_why +]
on-arrival: {!
// Z — 0.59: an alternative of the game on the model of the retaliation of B4. The nearest recorded event is the PPS march
// with a clash in Kraków on 10 II 1923 (HISTORICAL_SOURCES.md); breaking up a service itself is TBD.
PolishPolitics.cultChoose(Q, 'disrupt');
!}
go-to: result

@stay_out
title: Do not engage our organisations
subtitle: No cost. The Left of the party protests if we had promised a public answer.
choose-if: {! return PolishPolitics.cultStatus(Q, 'stay_out').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_b5_stay_out_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishPolitics.cultChoose(Q, 'stay_out');
!}
go-to: result

@result
new-page: true

= A commemoration of the assassin

[+ pl_b5_result +]

- @root: Continue.
